{
    "id":  "lowend",
    "name":  "Low-End FPS Boost",
    "description":  "For constrained hardware: everything in Safe plus reduced visual effects, fewer background apps (Edge/Chrome background modes, widgets, Store apps), no capture overhead, no P2P update uploads, fewer background telemetry tasks and a performance power plan.",
